    <div>
      電磁力 <span class="formula">F = I B l</span> ／ ローレンツ力 <span class="formula">f = q v B</span> ／ 誘導起電力 <span class="formula">V = v B l</span>
    </div>
    <ul>
      <li>法則：<span class="formula">V = -N \cdot <span class="frac"><span class="num">ΔΦ</span><span class="den">Δt</span></span></span>　（磁束 $\Phi = BS$、変化を嫌う向きに流れる）</li>
      <li>磁場中の荷電粒子の円運動：$m\frac{v^2}{r} = qvB \implies$ 半径 <span class="formula">r = <span class="frac"><span class="num">mv</span><span class="den">qB</span></span></span>、周期 <span class="formula">T = <span class="frac"><span class="num">2πm</span><span class="den">qB</span></span></span></li>
      <li>自己誘導：<span class="formula">V = -L \frac{ΔI}{Δt}</span> ／ コイルのE：<span class="formula">U = <span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den">2</span></span> L I²</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
