      実効値 <span class="formula">V_e = <span class="frac"><span class="num">V₀</span><span class="den">√2</span></span></span>　コイル <span class="formula">X_L = ωL</span>　コンデンサー <span class="formula">X_C = <span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den">ωC</span></span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="res-box">
      ★<b>RLC直列共振周波数</b>：$X_L = X_C \implies \omega L = \frac{1}{\omega C} \implies$ <span class="formula">f_0 = <span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den">2π√LC</span></span></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title"><span>原子物理の必須公式</span><span>光子E・物質波・質量欠損</span></div>
    <ul>
      <li>光子エネルギー：<span class="formula">E = hf = <span class="frac"><span class="num">hc</span><span class="den">λ</span></span></span>　運動量 <span class="formula">p = <span class="frac"><span class="num">h</span><span class="den">λ</span></span></span></li>
      <li>光電効果：<span class="formula">hf = W + K_{\max}</span>（$W$ は仕事関数、$K_{\max} = eV_0$ 阻止電圧）</li>
      <li>ド・ブロイ波長：<span class="formula">\lambda = <span class="frac"><span class="num">h</span><span class="den">p</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span class="num">h</span><span class="den">mv</span></span></span></li>
      <li>ボーアの量子条件：<span class="formula">2πr = nλ = n <span class="frac"><span class="num">h</span><span class="den">mv</span></span></span>　（エネルギー準位 $E_n = -\frac{13.6}{n^2}\text{ eV}$）</li>
      <li>放射壊変：<span class="formula">N = N₀ \left(<span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den">2</span></span>\right)^{\frac{t}{T}}</span> （$T$ は半減期）</li>
      <li>質量欠損：<span class="formula">ΔE = Δm \cdot c²</span>　<span class="trap">【単位注意】$\Delta m$ は必ず [kg] に直す！</span></li>
    </ul>
